Complexity
- Time complexity: O(n log n), because of sorting.
- Space complexity: (O(n), for storing the items.
Important points to remember
1. Fractional Knapsack uses the Greedy algorithm.
2. Calculate the ratio using value / weight.
3. Sort ratios in descending order.
4. min(w, capacity) determines how much weight to take.
5. Unlike 0/1 Knapsack, fractional knapsack allows taking part of an item.
Viva question: What is the main difference between Fractional Knapsack and 0/1 Knapsack?

Answer: Fractional Knapsack allows taking a fraction of an item, whereas 0/1 Knapsack allows only taking the whole item or not taking it at all.
